  "body": "$131K below CV, Very realistic vendor!\r\n\r\nThis is not just a house — it’s a lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 11B Mandarin Place, Half Moon Bay, where elevated views, peaceful surroundings and everyday convenience come together to create a home you’ll love coming back to.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across three levels, this home offers exceptional space, flexibility and privacy, making it ideal for families, extended families or those who simply value having room for everyone.\r\n\r\nThe ground level features a spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a welcoming hub for everyday family life and entertaining. A separate toilet adds extra convenience.\r\n\r\nThe second level provides a private retreat with one bedroom, a stylish ensuite and its own separate living space. The additional living area offers excellent flexibility and could easily be used as a second bedroom, home office or study, depending on your needs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs on the third level, you’ll find two further bedrooms serviced by a shared bathroom, providing a comfortable and private zone for family members or guests.\r\n\r\nWith separate living spaces across each level, everyone can enjoy their own space while still being connected under one roof — a rare combination of privacy, versatility and generous family living.\r\n\r\nEnjoy beautiful views towards Pigeon Mountain and overlooking the local rugby fields, creating an open, spacious outlook that is increasingly hard to find. Whether you’re enjoying your morning coffee, entertaining friends, or simply unwinding after a busy day, the outlook provides a wonderful sense of space and connection to the surrounding environment.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned in a sought-after Half Moon Bay location, you’ll be close to Half Moon Bay Marina, local shops, cafes, parks, schools and transport, while enjoying the lifestyle appeal of the Eastern Bays.\r\n\r\nThis is more than a property — it’s an opportunity to secure a home where the views, location and lifestyle come together.\r\n\r\nCome and experience 11B Mandarin Place for yourself. You may just find the lifestyle you’ve been looking for.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
